From 7fce3d34eddfff6361cb4de2c5b8789b88a552b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mikko Perttunen <mperttunen@nvidia.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 13:44:42 +0900
Subject: drm/tegra: Don't pass an ERR_PTR to drm_syncobj_replace_fence()
Git-commit: 7fce3d34eddfff6361cb4de2c5b8789b88a552b6
Patch-mainline: v7.4-rc1
References: git-fixes

When host1x_fence_create() fails, avoid trying to attach the error
pointer to the out syncobj.

Fixes: 13abe0bb15ce ("drm/tegra: Implement job submission part of new UAPI")
Signed-off-by: Mikko Perttunen <mperttunen@nvidia.com>
Signed-off-by: Thierry Reding <treding@nvidia.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260730-b4-host1x-syncobj-wait-v1-2-afa730410392@nvidia.com
Acked-by: Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de>

---
 drivers/gpu/drm/tegra/submit.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/tegra/submit.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/tegra/submit.c
index b4a88fb5a350..5c7a53f7ef6b 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/tegra/submit.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/tegra/submit.c
@@ -675,6 +675,7 @@ int tegra_drm_ioctl_channel_submit(struct drm_device *drm, void *data,
 		if (IS_ERR(fence)) {
 			err = PTR_ERR(fence);
 			SUBMIT_ERR(context, "failed to create postfence: %d", err);
+			goto put_job;
 		}
 
 		drm_syncobj_replace_fence(syncobj, fence);
-- 
